    This set of files is considered "released" by TSC LLC as static reference documents.  Wow.

    Also: a learning about release/changelog edits.  Previous edits copied the contents of release
    to the changelog AFTER the release file was edited; convention now is to copy the contents of the
    release (the previous release) to the changelog BEFORE editing the release file for this release.

    This results in the combined content of RELEASE (this) and CHANGELOG (past)
        telling the story completely without duplication.

